1
00:00:22,799 --> 00:00:26,683
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,083 --> 00:00:33,698
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,571 --> 00:00:40,709
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,047 --> 00:00:47,056
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,267 --> 00:00:51,188
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,399 --> 00:00:54,490
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,787 --> 00:00:59,022
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,007 --> 00:01:03,915
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,213 --> 00:01:07,099
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,409 --> 00:01:12,191
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,191 --> 00:01:16,771
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,771 --> 00:01:18,770
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,973 --> 00:01:24,755
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,139 --> 00:01:29,450
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,450 --> 00:01:31,958
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,204 --> 00:01:42,421
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,871 --> 00:01:48,705
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,705 --> 00:01:51,623
=Episode 9=

19
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,920
Suzhen, we've been walking for an hour,

20
00:01:59,079 --> 00:02:00,560
and we're still near Xu Xian's house.

21
00:02:02,359 --> 00:02:04,439
You don't actually want
to leave, do you?

22
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:08,680
I can't just leave like this.

23
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:10,400
I can't swallow this.

24
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:14,680
Well, why bother
getting upset over a mortal?

25
00:02:15,319 --> 00:02:17,680
A mortal's lifespan
is barely a hundred years.

26
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:19,719
Even if he can help you ascend,

27
00:02:20,159 --> 00:02:21,759
you don't need to get attached to him.

28
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:25,560
Besides, Xu Xian is riddled with flaws.

29
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:27,159
He's rigid,

30
00:02:27,159 --> 00:02:28,159
dull,

31
00:02:28,199 --> 00:02:29,199
and stubborn.

32
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:32,919
The only decent thing
about him is his face.

33
00:02:33,319 --> 00:02:36,520
But he's still far inferior
to those handsome men in the storybooks.

34
00:02:36,919 --> 00:02:39,680
Most importantly, he is so ungrateful.

35
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,080
You've gone out of your way for him,

36
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:44,120
yet he doesn't appreciate it.

37
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:56,639
Though Miss Bai

38
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:59,759
is a bit ignorant
of the ways of the world,

39
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:02,919
she has always had
your best interests at heart.

40
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:09,319
I heard she went to the Zhao's shop

41
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:11,479
to buy me a birthday gift.

42
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:14,800
Think about it. Was that really for me?

43
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:17,639
Actually, it was all for you.

44
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:20,120
Why?

45
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,800
To make you look good.

46
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:25,159
Your uncle and I know
all about those birthday gifts

47
00:03:25,439 --> 00:03:27,199
you give us every year.

48
00:03:28,439 --> 00:03:29,599
I never gave any.

49
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,520
You just refuse to admit it.

50
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:33,960
Listen,

51
00:03:34,199 --> 00:03:35,919
if you really don't want
Miss Bai to leave,

52
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,560
then go bring her back.

53
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:42,520
Believe it or not,
she's still near your house right now.

54
00:03:48,199 --> 00:03:49,520
Why are you looking at me?

55
00:03:49,879 --> 00:03:51,080
Go bring her back.

56
00:03:55,199 --> 00:03:57,800
He's indeed dull

57
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,759
and rigid.

58
00:04:00,719 --> 00:04:02,039
But I think

59
00:04:02,879 --> 00:04:06,240
he's much better than those playboys
who frequent the brothels.

60
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:10,520
He looks quite decent.

61
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:14,840
It's true that he's ungrateful.

62
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,800
But after all,

63
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,720
this is a love trial,

64
00:04:19,959 --> 00:04:21,759
so it's supposed
to be a bit of difficult.

65
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:28,480
Suzhen, why are you defending him now?

66
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:31,439
Don't tell me you're falling for him.

67
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:36,120
Absolutely not.

68
00:04:36,439 --> 00:04:37,800
He's nothing but a mere mortal.

69
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:39,240
He doesn't deserve you.

70
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:43,839
How is this possible?

71
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,519
How could I ever fall for him?

72
00:04:46,759 --> 00:04:50,319
I just want him to fall for me sooner,

73
00:04:50,439 --> 00:04:51,439
so I can ascend faster.

74
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:53,600
Miss Bai.

75
00:04:53,839 --> 00:04:54,879
Young Master Qing.

76
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:57,439
I knew you two are still here.

77
00:04:57,439 --> 00:04:58,839
Aunt, why are you here?

78
00:04:59,319 --> 00:05:01,360
I came to thank you
for your thoughtful gift.

79
00:05:03,079 --> 00:05:06,319
Aunt, you know about it?

80
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:09,399
I heard you
arguing with Xu Xian just now.

81
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:11,879
Where are you going to stay tonight?

82
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:16,319
Xu Xian is a bit ignorant
of the ways of the world.

83
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:18,519
He is rigid, dull,

84
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:19,800
and stubborn.

85
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:22,959
A man like that needs
to be left to stew for a while.

86
00:05:23,399 --> 00:05:25,800
Otherwise, he'll never cherish
those who around him.

87
00:05:26,199 --> 00:05:27,199
Do you agree?

88
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:29,600
Come on, stay at my house.

89
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:32,160
Stay for several days
and let him stew for a bit.

90
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:36,040
Young Master Qing, you come along too.

91
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:37,920
My husband is a constable.

92
00:05:38,199 --> 00:05:40,600
You can help me teach him a lesson.

93
00:05:42,199 --> 00:05:43,199
No problem.

94
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,160
Let's go.

95
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:59,519
Fellow townsfolk!

96
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:03,519
Xu Xian, relying on his uncle Fang Qiru
being a constable,

97
00:06:03,759 --> 00:06:06,279
indulged his lover, Bai Suzhen,

98
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:08,040
in committing assault.

99
00:06:08,399 --> 00:06:10,279
Not only did she slap me in the face,

100
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:12,920
she also smashed
my family's jade carving.

101
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:14,560
And she refused to compensate.

102
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:20,399
My poor, elderly mother is over seventy,

103
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:23,439
and now she's bedridden.

104
00:06:23,759 --> 00:06:26,519
Tell me, if Xu Xian doesn't
compensate me thousands of taels,

105
00:06:26,759 --> 00:06:27,800
how can that be justified?

106
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,319
It can't be, right?

107
00:06:31,399 --> 00:06:33,720
This Zhao brat usually bullies people,

108
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,720
and now he's playing the victim.

109
00:06:36,279 --> 00:06:37,759
Don't let him latch onto you.

110
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:39,720
Aunt.

111
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:44,680
She told me to come
make birthday pastries with her.

112
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,680
Where is she?

113
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:04,120
Suzhen.

114
00:07:08,199 --> 00:07:10,000
That Zhao brat came to cause trouble.

115
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:11,600
He's making a scene at the front gate.

116
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:12,600
Aunt has rushed over.

117
00:07:14,519 --> 00:07:15,959
Perfect timing to vent.

118
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:17,720
Let's go.

119
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,560
Zhao Puxin,

120
00:07:21,439 --> 00:07:22,680
your shouting

121
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:26,279
has scared off sparrows under my eaves.

122
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:31,000
What? Did you not learn your lesson?

123
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:33,560
Are you here for another round today?

124
00:07:34,279 --> 00:07:36,439
Y-You... Lu Wenhui!

125
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:42,240
As the matriarch of Fang family,
how can you aid and abet evil?

126
00:07:42,399 --> 00:07:44,399
That Bai Suzhen,

127
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:45,560
she hit me!

128
00:07:47,519 --> 00:07:49,759
All the neighbors here know it.

129
00:07:50,199 --> 00:07:51,240
Zhao Puxin.

130
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:53,920
What do you want?

131
00:07:54,839 --> 00:07:57,120
How dare you come here
and twist the truth.

132
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,560
Don't blame me if I get rough.

133
00:07:59,879 --> 00:08:00,879
Qing.

134
00:08:01,639 --> 00:08:02,639
Hold on.

135
00:08:04,199 --> 00:08:07,480
Such a trifle doesn't need
Young Master Qing to step in.

136
00:08:08,279 --> 00:08:09,680
Just leave it to me.

137
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:11,879
Everyone,

138
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:15,040
since Zhao Puxin here
wants you all to uphold justice,

139
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:17,319
then I may trouble you for a while.

140
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:22,439
Miss Bai beside me
looks delicate and frail.

141
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:25,079
How could she possibly
injure Young Master Zhao severely?

142
00:08:25,759 --> 00:08:29,399
Moreover, Young Master Zhao
claims his injuries are severe,

143
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:33,240
yet today he's making a big show
with voice as loud as thunder.

144
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:34,840
- True.
- Yeah.

145
00:08:35,799 --> 00:08:37,519
Bai Suzhen, you tell them.

146
00:08:37,519 --> 00:08:38,759
Did you hit me?

147
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:44,600
If no one harassed her first,

148
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:48,200
why would a young woman like her
try every mean to defend herself?

149
00:08:48,799 --> 00:08:51,279
Zhao Puxin, do you admit it?

150
00:08:51,799 --> 00:08:53,399
You saw Miss Bai,

151
00:08:53,399 --> 00:08:54,559
coveted her,

152
00:08:54,799 --> 00:08:56,720
and tried to harass her.

153
00:08:57,440 --> 00:08:58,440
Exactly.

154
00:08:58,440 --> 00:09:01,440
Zhao Puxin harassed a girl
on the street before.

155
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:03,519
Yeah, he's a repeat offender.

156
00:09:03,919 --> 00:09:06,120
Shut up! All of you, shut up!

157
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:09,600
S-She indeed smashed my jade carving!

158
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:10,960
What a coincidence.

159
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:15,679
The pawnshop owner in the east part
of town admitted it himself

160
00:09:15,679 --> 00:09:16,159
(Pawnshop receipt)

161
00:09:16,159 --> 00:09:17,879
that your family heirloom

162
00:09:17,879 --> 00:09:20,039
was pawned by you long ago
to fuel your gambling.

163
00:09:20,519 --> 00:09:22,120
The one that got smashed

164
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:25,679
is a fake you bought last year
for a measly three qian.

165
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:35,399
Then her husband Fang Qiru must have

166
00:09:35,519 --> 00:09:37,240
threatened the pawnshop owner.

167
00:09:38,559 --> 00:09:40,399
As a constable, my husband

168
00:09:40,679 --> 00:09:42,039
gets salary from the government

169
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:44,039
and has always been upright and honest.

170
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:45,320
You're slandering him.

171
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:47,039
Aren't you afraid

172
00:09:47,039 --> 00:09:48,360
that you'd get doubly guilty?

173
00:09:48,559 --> 00:09:51,399
After all, you've already
committed extortion

174
00:09:51,399 --> 00:09:53,320
and harassment of a woman.

175
00:09:56,159 --> 00:09:57,159
Hurry up!

176
00:09:57,159 --> 00:09:58,759
What took you so long?

177
00:09:58,759 --> 00:09:59,759
I'm telling you,

178
00:09:59,759 --> 00:10:01,480
Lu Wenhui

179
00:10:02,159 --> 00:10:03,639
is abusing her power to bully me.

180
00:10:10,879 --> 00:10:13,279
Madam Zhao is already aware
of the full story.

181
00:10:13,279 --> 00:10:14,360
She sent me to apologize.

182
00:10:15,559 --> 00:10:17,600
We've prepared a birthday gift for you,

183
00:10:17,799 --> 00:10:20,080
and someone will deliver it shortly.

184
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:22,000
Thank you.

185
00:10:22,879 --> 00:10:26,000
Madam Zhao has prepared
another gift for you.

186
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,360
Please accept it.

187
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:36,440
You hit me?

188
00:10:36,679 --> 00:10:37,879
What's wrong with you?

189
00:10:38,279 --> 00:10:39,919
Madam Zhao told me to do so.

190
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:42,679
She also sent you a message.

191
00:10:45,799 --> 00:10:47,679
You wretched son!

192
00:10:48,039 --> 00:10:51,279
If you keep misbehaving like this,

193
00:10:51,279 --> 00:10:54,399
I'll kick you out of the Zhao family.

194
00:10:54,879 --> 00:10:56,200
Young Master Zhao, let's go home.

195
00:10:56,919 --> 00:10:57,919
You!

196
00:10:57,919 --> 00:10:59,840
Young Master Zhao, if you keep this up,

197
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:01,360
Madam Zhao might have another gift.

198
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:04,759
Make way!

199
00:11:06,879 --> 00:11:07,879
Young Master Zhao!

200
00:11:07,879 --> 00:11:08,879
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

201
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:11,200
Miss Bai,

202
00:11:11,519 --> 00:11:13,159
since you're staying at my house,

203
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:15,080
I'll shelter you.

204
00:11:15,879 --> 00:11:17,679
Come with me to the kitchen.

205
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:18,840
Okay.

206
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:23,240
Aunt, you are amazing.

207
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:25,440
(Xu Xian's aunt)

208
00:11:25,759 --> 00:11:27,679
(is now the only mortal I like.)

209
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:34,399
Uncle invited me for tea.

210
00:11:34,399 --> 00:11:35,399
Why are you here?

211
00:11:36,919 --> 00:11:38,200
I'm here to mooch a meal.

212
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:40,519
Your aunt and uncle are kind people,

213
00:11:40,759 --> 00:11:41,799
so they won't mind.

214
00:11:46,120 --> 00:11:48,000
You had a spat with Miss Bai,

215
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,080
so you should go make up.

216
00:11:49,279 --> 00:11:50,759
Both of you refuse to back down.

217
00:11:50,759 --> 00:11:51,759
What is this?

218
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:52,840
Besides,

219
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:55,399
Miss Bai went
to that Zhao's shop for you.

220
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,840
Aren't you a monk?

221
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:03,399
I'm just a disciple.

222
00:12:04,159 --> 00:12:07,320
Does that mean
you can butt in on my business?

223
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:09,559
I don't want to.

224
00:12:09,559 --> 00:12:11,799
But as a friend,
I can't just watch you be so blind.

225
00:12:11,799 --> 00:12:13,759
- You clearly like...
- No, I don't.

226
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:19,000
I'm sure you know it best.

227
00:12:27,039 --> 00:12:28,039
Uncle.

228
00:12:28,399 --> 00:12:29,399
Captain Fang,

229
00:12:29,679 --> 00:12:30,679
do you still remember me?

230
00:12:30,679 --> 00:12:32,399
I'm Fahai from Jinshan Temple.

231
00:12:33,399 --> 00:12:34,759
Fahai.

232
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:39,639
The most handsome head disciple
of Jinshan Temple.

233
00:12:39,639 --> 00:12:41,720
You surely have a great memory.

234
00:12:41,919 --> 00:12:45,159
Oh, my master asked me
to bring you this protective charm

235
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:46,679
to ward off evil and disasters.

236
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:48,600
Thank your master for me.

237
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:52,279
Let's wait out front.

238
00:12:52,279 --> 00:12:54,240
Your aunt and the others
will be here soon.

239
00:12:55,039 --> 00:12:56,039
Okay.

240
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:03,200
Xu Xian, why don't you go over?

241
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:04,600
You have to make the first move.

242
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:10,720
Aunt.

243
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:16,200
You're here too.

244
00:13:16,279 --> 00:13:18,279
You followed us here
last night, didn't you?

245
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:30,159
Well, your aunt
made these pastries today.

246
00:13:30,159 --> 00:13:32,720
You all must have a good taste today.

247
00:13:32,720 --> 00:13:33,720
Let's have a taste.

248
00:13:34,679 --> 00:13:35,679
Come on.

249
00:13:38,320 --> 00:13:40,600
Aunt made them herself?

250
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:45,559
These pastries must taste perfect.

251
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:05,919
Fahai, take it easy, don't choke.

252
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:07,320
You eat too.

253
00:14:07,559 --> 00:14:08,559
Delicious.

254
00:14:09,039 --> 00:14:10,240
It's okay. You eat.

255
00:14:18,159 --> 00:14:20,759
- Come on, one for each of you.
- Come on.

256
00:14:21,559 --> 00:14:22,559
Here, one for you.

257
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:43,600
Is it good?

258
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:48,360
- Yes.
- Yes.

259
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:49,840
Delicious.

260
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:53,000
Fahai, take it easy, don't choke.

261
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,720
I'll make you more later.

262
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:57,360
Bring some back
for your fellow disciples.

263
00:15:00,039 --> 00:15:01,320
Stop stuffing your face.

264
00:15:02,559 --> 00:15:04,200
Aunt made them for Xu Xian.

265
00:15:04,759 --> 00:15:06,320
Xu Xian, have some more.

266
00:15:08,279 --> 00:15:09,279
You...

267
00:15:09,279 --> 00:15:10,559
What did you say?

268
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:15,960
Aunt thinks about you all the time.

269
00:15:16,200 --> 00:15:18,000
She made these pastries
especially for you.

270
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:19,480
You should have some more.

271
00:15:20,240 --> 00:15:22,639
What? Do you think they're not good?

272
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:25,200
Xu Xian, you don't come home often.

273
00:15:25,200 --> 00:15:26,200
Eat a few more.

274
00:15:29,399 --> 00:15:30,399
Okay.

275
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:38,879
All of you, make sure you finish them.

276
00:15:38,879 --> 00:15:39,879
Heard me?

277
00:15:41,240 --> 00:15:43,399
Uncle, you should eat some too.

278
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:46,080
Oh, my brain.

279
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:48,480
I still have work to do

280
00:15:48,480 --> 00:15:50,440
at the yamen.

281
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:51,879
I completely forgot.

282
00:15:52,759 --> 00:15:54,799
I have to go back to the yamen now.

283
00:15:55,679 --> 00:15:57,200
Alright, I'll see you off.

284
00:15:57,200 --> 00:15:58,200
Okay.

285
00:16:06,039 --> 00:16:08,480
You guys, finish them all.

286
00:16:53,274 --> 00:16:57,433
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

287
00:16:59,900 --> 00:17:04,278
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

288
00:17:05,821 --> 00:17:11,646
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

289
00:17:12,415 --> 00:17:16,882
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

290
00:17:19,747 --> 00:17:24,188
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

291
00:17:26,384 --> 00:17:31,114
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

292
00:17:32,326 --> 00:17:38,439
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

293
00:17:39,102 --> 00:17:44,884
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

294
00:17:44,884 --> 00:17:51,147
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

295
00:17:51,457 --> 00:17:57,816
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

296
00:17:57,987 --> 00:18:05,354
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

297
00:18:05,639 --> 00:18:11,186
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

298
00:18:11,677 --> 00:18:17,887
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

299
00:18:18,197 --> 00:18:24,970
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

300
00:18:25,967 --> 00:18:31,620
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

301
00:18:32,454 --> 00:18:36,862
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

302
00:18:37,627 --> 00:18:40,215
♪Having ever loved♪
